<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>9.8.5: Lesson Summary</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02468</md:content-id>
    <md:title>9.8.5: Lesson Summary</md:title>
    <md:uuid>51c03b4b-ef97-4c2e-a514-7db7fd46d190</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>In this lesson, you learned how to:</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> Explain the steps and complete some missing steps for deriving the quadratic formula. </item>
  <item> Explain how the quadratic formula is related to the process of completing the square for a quadratic equation \(ax^2+bx+c=0\). </item>
</list>
<para>Here are the <emphasis>activities</emphasis> that helped you reach those goals:</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> 9.8.1: Deriving the Quadratic Formula, Part 1
    <list>
      <item>In this activity, you learned how to derive the quadratic formula by completing the square for a quadratic equation without evaluating some of the numerical expressions along the way.</item>
      <item>9.8.1: Self Check</item>
      <item>9.8.1: Additional Resources</item>
    </list>
  </item>
  <item> 9.8.2: Deriving the Quadratic Formula, Part 2
    <list>
      <item>In this activity, you studied a series of steps to solve \(ax^2+bx+c=0\) by completing the square and making sense of how it leads to the quadratic formula.</item>
      <item>9.8.2: Self Check</item>
      <item>9.8.2: Additional Resources</item>
    </list>
  </item>
  <item> 9.8.3: Understanding That the Quadratic Formula Is the Combined Steps of Completing the Square
    <list>
      <item>In this activity, you had to explain parts of a solution for solving an equation by completing the square, where each step was shown, but numerical expressions were not evaluated.</item>
    </list>
  </item>
</list>
<para>After these activities, you completed the following <emphasis>practice</emphasis>:</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent">
  <item> 9.8.4: Practice </item>
</list>
<title>Checking In</title>
